OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers left without internet
OL,4,Afor weeks... again
OL,5,
OL,6,FVillagers have been without internet
OL,7,Ffor over two weeks after a storm
OL,8,Fknocked out their connection.
OL,10,FStorm Austen on 22 October has been
OL,11,Fblamed for the online blackout to 114
OL,12,Fhomes in Rougham, Suffolk. The village
OL,13,Fwent without the internet for over a
OL,14,Fmonth in 2020 after another storm.
OL,16,FDeborah Hockey, who lives there, said
OL,17,Fit had meant she had struggled to speak
OL,18,Fto her 96-year-old father who lives
OL,19,Falone 100 miles away, leaving him
OL,20,Ffeeling "quite anxious".
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
