OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers left without internet
OL,4,Afor weeks... again
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for wi-fi providers
OL,7,FCityFibre said they wanted to apologise
OL,8,Fto residents and added that the firm's
OL,9,Fteam was "working hard to resolve the
OL,10,Fissue as quickly as possible".
